msgid "Background {#background}"
msgstr "Background {#background}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A QCSC workflow runs a QPU and an HPC system as one machine.\n"
"[QCSC-Prefect](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qcsc-prefect) runs QCSC workflows on\n"
"[Prefect](https://www.prefect.io/) and keeps them traceable, configurable, and resumable.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pinapatakbo ng isang QCSC workflow ang isang QPU at isang HPC system bilang isang makina.\n"
"Pinapatakbo ng [QCSC-Prefect](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qcsc-prefect) ang mga QCSC workflow sa [Prefect](https://www.prefect.io/) at pinananatili silang masusubaybayan, na-configure, at maipagpapatuloy.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This tutorial demonstrates these features with sample-based quantum diagonalization (SQD) of the N$_2$ molecule. The [Quantum Resource Management Interface (QRMI)](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qrmi) samples the circuit inside a [Slurm](https://slurm.schedmd.com/) job. The\n"
"[Fulqrum](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-fulqrum) eigensolver diagonalizes the sampled\n"
"subspaces in more Slurm jobs. One [Prefect Cloud](https://www.prefect.io/cloud) deployment runs both.\n"
msgstr "Ipinapakita ng tutorial na ito ang mga feature na ito gamit ang sample-based quantum diagonalization (SQD) ng N$_2$ molecule. Sina-sample ng [Quantum Resource Management Interface (QRMI)](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qrmi) ang Circuit sa loob ng isang [Slurm](https://slurm.schedmd.com/) job. Dina-diagonalize ng eigensolver na [Fulqrum](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-fulqrum) ang mga na-sample na subspace sa mas maraming Slurm job. Pinapatakbo ng isang [Prefect Cloud](https://www.prefect.io/cloud) deployment ang dalawa.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "QCSC-Prefect also runs large QCSC workloads, as in the following projects.\n"
msgstr "Nagpapatakbo rin ang QCSC-Prefect ng malalaking QCSC workload, tulad ng sa mga sumusunod na proyekto.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A study of protein-ligand complexes with more than 12,000 atoms used QCSC-Prefect. It\n"
"sampled quantum-embedding fragments on two 156-qubit IBM Quantum processors, with up to 94\n"
"qubits, and diagonalized the fragment subspaces on the Fugaku, Miyabi-G, and ROQUO\n"
"supercomputers [\\[1\\]](#references).\n"
msgstr "Gumamit ng QCSC-Prefect ang isang pag-aaral ng mga protein-ligand complex na may mahigit 12,000 atom. Nag-sample ito ng mga quantum-embedding fragment sa dalawang 156-qubit na IBM Quantum processor, na hanggang 94 na qubit, at dina-diagonalize ang mga fragment subspace sa mga supercomputer na Fugaku, Miyabi-G, at ROQUO [\\[1\\]](#references).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A study of iron-sulfur clusters ran an extended QCSC-Prefect SQD workflow with 36 orbitals\n"
"(72 qubits) and subspace dimensions up to $3 \\times 10^{10}$ on the Fugaku, Miyabi, and\n"
"ROQUO supercomputers [\\[2\\]](#references).\n"
msgstr "Nagpatakbo ang isang pag-aaral ng mga iron-sulfur cluster ng pinalawak na QCSC-Prefect SQD workflow na may 36 na orbital (72 qubit) at subspace dimension na hanggang $3 \\times 10^{10}$ sa mga supercomputer na Fugaku, Miyabi, at ROQUO [\\[2\\]](#references).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "The challenge of QCSC workflows {#the-challenge-of-qcsc-workflows}"
msgstr "Ang hamon ng mga QCSC workflow {#the-challenge-of-qcsc-workflows}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The SQD workflow is typical of QCSC workloads. QCSC-Prefect answers each of its challenges\n"
"with one feature, as in the following table.\n"
msgstr "Tipikal ang SQD workflow sa mga QCSC workload. Sinasagot ng QCSC-Prefect ang bawat hamon nito gamit ang isang feature, tulad ng sa sumusunod na talahanayan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Challenge | QCSC-Prefect feature |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| It spans several resources. A Slurm job holds the QPU, then many Slurm jobs diagonalize subspaces, round after round. | Traceable workflow |\n"
"| It has many parameters at different levels (science, circuit, and cluster), and credentials must stay out of all of them. | Configurable parameters |\n"
"| It is long and can fail anywhere, from a walltime limit, a node failure, or a long QPU queue. Without care, a late failure means sampling on the QPU again. | Resumable execution |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Hamon | Feature ng QCSC-Prefect |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| Sumasaklaw ito ng ilang resource. Hawak ng isang Slurm job ang QPU, tapos maraming Slurm job ang nagdi-diagonalize ng mga subspace, round after round. | Masusubaybayang workflow |\n"
"| Maraming parameter ito sa iba't ibang antas (agham, Circuit, at cluster), at dapat nasa labas ng lahat ng ito ang mga credential. | Mga na-configure na parameter |\n"
"| Mahaba ito at maaaring pumalya kahit saan, mula sa walltime limit, pagkabigo ng node, o mahabang pila sa QPU. Kung walang ingat, ang huling pagkabigo ay nangangahulugang magsa-sample ulit sa QPU. | Maipagpapatuloy na execution |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each step of [Qiskit Pattern in QCSC-Prefect step by step](#qiskit-pattern-in-qcsc-prefect-step-by-step) ends with a box that shows how QCSC-Prefect traces, configures, and resumes that stage.\n"
msgstr "Ang bawat hakbang ng [Qiskit Pattern sa QCSC-Prefect, hakbang-hakbang](#qiskit-pattern-in-qcsc-prefect-step-by-step) ay nagtatapos sa isang kahon na nagpapakita kung paano sinusubaybayan, kino-configure, at ipinagpapatuloy ng QCSC-Prefect ang yugtong iyon.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Traceable workflow {#traceable-workflow}"
msgstr "Masusubaybayang workflow {#traceable-workflow}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A Prefect *flow* is a Python function made of *tasks*. QCSC-Prefect makes each stage of a\n"
"[Qiskit pattern](/guides/intro-to-patterns) (**Map**, **Optimize**, **Execute**, and **Postprocess**) one task. For every run, Prefect Cloud shows the following information:\n"
msgstr "Ang Prefect *flow* ay isang Python function na binubuo ng mga *task*. Ginagawa ng QCSC-Prefect na isang task ang bawat yugto ng isang [Qiskit pattern](/guides/intro-to-patterns) (**Map**, **Optimize**, **Execute**, at **Postprocess**). Para sa bawat run, ipinapakita ng Prefect Cloud ang sumusunod na impormasyon:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The task graph, with an arrow wherever one task passes its result to another.\n"
msgstr "Ang task graph, na may arrow saanman ipinapasa ng isang task ang resulta nito sa iba.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The state, inputs, logs, and duration of each task, filterable by the stage tags `map`, `optimize`, `execute`, and `post-process`.\n"
msgstr "Ang state, mga input, mga log, at tagal ng bawat task, na mafi-filter ayon sa mga stage tag na `map`, `optimize`, `execute`, at `post-process`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The *artifacts*, which are tables and links that tasks publish, such as the source of the\n"
"samples or the energy of each subspace.\n"
msgstr "Ang mga *artifact*, na mga talahanayan at link na ini-publish ng mga task, tulad ng pinagmulan ng mga sample o ang enerhiya ng bawat subspace.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The workflow host only submits and monitors work. The compute-intensive work runs as Slurm jobs, as in the following image.\n"
msgstr "Nagsusumite at nagmo-monitor lang ng gawain ang workflow host. Ang compute-intensive na gawain ay tumatakbo bilang mga Slurm job, tulad ng sa sumusunod na larawan.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Prefect Cloud holds the runs, logs, and artifacts. The workflow host polls Prefect Cloud for runs and reports states and logs. The served deployment on the workflow host submits and monitors the Slurm jobs. The workflow host submits a Slurm job (`sbatch --qpu`) that runs the QRMI worker, which transpiles the circuit and samples it on the IBM Quantum QPU. It also submits one Fulqrum Slurm job (`sbatch`) per subspace.](/docs/images/tutorials/qcsc-prefect/where-work-runs.svg 'What runs where')\n"
msgstr "![Prefect Cloud holds the runs, logs, and artifacts. The workflow host polls Prefect Cloud for runs and reports states and logs. The served deployment on the workflow host submits and monitors the Slurm jobs. The workflow host submits a Slurm job (`sbatch --qpu`) that runs the QRMI worker, which transpiles the circuit and samples it on the IBM Quantum QPU. It also submits one Fulqrum Slurm job (`sbatch`) per subspace.](/docs/images/tutorials/qcsc-prefect/where-work-runs.svg 'What runs where')\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configurable parameters {#configurable-parameters}"
msgstr "Mga na-configure na parameter {#configurable-parameters}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "QCSC-Prefect keeps each kind of setting in its own place, as in the following table.\n"
msgstr "Inilalagay ng QCSC-Prefect ang bawat uri ng setting sa sarili nitong lugar, tulad ng sa sumusunod na talahanayan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Kind | Examples | Changes | Where it lives |\n"
"|---|---|---|---|\n"
"| Run parameters | Molecule, shots, subspace dimension | Every run | The Prefect Cloud run form, grouped by stage |\n"
"| Blocks | Partition, walltime, threads, executable paths, QPU resource | Per cluster | Prefect blocks, created one time |\n"
"| Credentials | Prefect API key, IBM Quantum API key | Rarely | The Prefect Cloud login on the workflow host, and QRMI (`qcsc-qrmi login`) on the cluster, both set up in the setup guide |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Uri | Mga halimbawa | Nagbabago | Kung saan ito nakalagay |\n"
"|---|---|---|---|\n"
"| Mga run parameter | Molecule, shots, subspace dimension | Bawat run | Ang run form ng Prefect Cloud, naka-group ayon sa yugto |\n"
"| Mga block | Partition, walltime, thread, path ng executable, QPU resource | Bawat cluster | Mga Prefect block, ginawa nang isang beses |\n"
"| Mga credential | Prefect API key, IBM Quantum API key | Bihira | Ang Prefect Cloud login sa workflow host, at QRMI (`qcsc-qrmi login`) sa cluster, na parehong na-set up sa setup guide |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The blocks describe each job in the three layers of the following table.\n"
msgstr "Inilalarawan ng mga block ang bawat job sa tatlong layer ng sumusunod na talahanayan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Block | Specifies | Contents |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `CommandBlock` | What runs | The executable and its default arguments |\n"
"| `ExecutionProfileBlock` | How it runs | Nodes, threads, walltime, launcher, modules, and environment |\n"
"| `HPCProfileBlock` | Where it runs | Scheduler, partition, account, and the path of each executable on that system |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Block | Tinutukoy | Nilalaman |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `CommandBlock` | Ano ang tumatakbo | Ang executable at ang mga default na argument nito |\n"
"| `ExecutionProfileBlock` | Paano ito tumatakbo | Mga node, thread, walltime, launcher, module, at environment |\n"
"| `HPCProfileBlock` | Saan ito tumatakbo | Scheduler, partition, account, at ang path ng bawat executable sa system na iyon |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The flow loads blocks by name when it runs, so a change to a block leaves the flow and its run\n"
"parameters unchanged.\n"
msgstr "Nilo-load ng flow ang mga block ayon sa pangalan kapag tumatakbo ito, kaya ang pagbabago sa isang block ay hindi nakakaapekto sa flow at sa mga run parameter nito.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Resumable execution {#resumable-execution}"
msgstr "Maipagpapatuloy na execution {#resumable-execution}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Prefect stores the results of the first three stages with the flow run. If a later task\n"
"fails, **Retry** on the flow run reuses the stored results and runs only what failed, as in\n"
"the following image.\n"
msgstr "Iniimbak ng Prefect ang mga resulta ng unang tatlong yugto kasama ng flow run. Kung pumalya ang isang susunod na task, ang **Retry** sa flow run ay gumagamit muli ng mga nakaimbak na resulta at pinapatakbo lang ang pumalya, tulad ng sa sumusunod na larawan.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![When a run fails and you raise the walltime in the block, Retry repeats only the last stage and reuses the results of the first three stages.](/docs/images/tutorials/qcsc-prefect/retry-failed-run.svg 'Retry a failed run')\n"
msgstr "![When a run fails and you raise the walltime in the block, Retry repeats only the last stage and reuses the results of the first three stages.](/docs/images/tutorials/qcsc-prefect/retry-failed-run.svg 'Retry a failed run')\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A new run can also load the samples of an earlier run instead of sampling, because the Execute\n"
"stage records where its samples are.\n"
msgstr "Maaari ring mag-load ang bagong run ng mga sample ng naunang run sa halip na mag-sample, dahil itinatala ng Execute stage kung nasaan ang mga sample nito.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "SQD at a glance {#sqd-at-a-glance}"
msgstr "Sulyap sa SQD {#sqd-at-a-glance}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"SQD samples bitstrings from a local unitary cluster Jastrow (LUCJ) circuit built from coupled cluster singles and doubles (CCSD) amplitudes, fixes the\n"
"bitstrings that noise has corrupted (*configuration recovery*), and diagonalizes the\n"
"Hamiltonian in subspaces spanned by the sampled configurations [\\[3\\]](#references). The\n"
"[SQD tutorial](/tutorials/sample-based-quantum-diagonalization) explains the algorithm. In QCSC-Prefect, SQD is the\n"
"flow `sqd`, which has the following task graph.\n"
msgstr "Nagsa-sample ang SQD ng mga bitstring mula sa isang local unitary cluster Jastrow (LUCJ) circuit na binuo mula sa coupled cluster singles and doubles (CCSD) amplitude, inaayos ang mga bitstring na sinira ng noise (*configuration recovery*), at dina-diagonalize ang Hamiltonian sa mga subspace na sakop ng mga na-sample na configuration [\\[3\\]](#references). Ipinapaliwanag ng [SQD tutorial](/tutorials/sample-based-quantum-diagonalization) ang algorithm. Sa QCSC-Prefect, ang SQD ay ang flow na `sqd`, na may sumusunod na task graph.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Stage | Task | Input from another task |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| Map | `compute_molecular_integrals` | None |\n"
"| Optimize | `get_lucj_params` | Integrals from Map |\n"
"| Execute | `quantum_sampling`, with `build_lucj_circuit` inside it | LUCJ parameters from Optimize |\n"
"| Postprocess | `sqd_loop` | Integrals from Map, and samples from Execute |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Yugto | Task | Input mula sa ibang task |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| Map | `compute_molecular_integrals` | Wala |\n"
"| Optimize | `get_lucj_params` | Mga integral mula sa Map |\n"
"| Execute | `quantum_sampling`, na may `build_lucj_circuit` sa loob nito | Mga LUCJ parameter mula sa Optimize |\n"
"| Postprocess | `sqd_loop` | Mga integral mula sa Map, at mga sample mula sa Execute |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When a run reuses samples, `load_qrmi_result` (or `load_runtime_job` for samples from IBM\n"
"Quantum Platform) replaces both `get_lucj_params` and `quantum_sampling`, so the run has no\n"
"Optimize task. In random mode (**Quantum Source** set to `random`), there is no Optimize or\n"
"Execute task, and Map feeds `sqd_loop` directly.\n"
msgstr "Kapag gumagamit muli ng mga sample ang isang run, pinapalitan ng `load_qrmi_result` (o `load_runtime_job` para sa mga sample mula sa IBM Quantum Platform) ang parehong `get_lucj_params` at `quantum_sampling`, kaya walang Optimize task ang run. Sa random mode (**Quantum Source** na nakatakda sa `random`), walang Optimize o Execute task, at direktang nagpapakain ang Map sa `sqd_loop`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The example is N$_2$ at a bond length of 1.1 $\\AA$ in the 6-31G basis, with the two 1s core\n"
"orbitals frozen. This leaves 16 spatial orbitals with five $\\alpha$ and five $\\beta$ electrons,\n"
"which is a 32-qubit circuit.\n"
msgstr "Ang halimbawa ay ang N$_2$ sa bond length na 1.1 $\\AA$ sa 6-31G basis, na naka-freeze ang dalawang 1s core orbital. Nag-iiwan ito ng 16 na spatial orbital na may limang $\\alpha$ at limang $\\beta$ na electron, na isang 32-qubit na Circuit.\n"

