# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Pattern in QCSC-Prefect step by step {#qiskit-pattern-in-qcsc-prefect-step-by-step}"
msgstr "Qiskit Pattern sa QCSC-Prefect, hakbang-hakbang {#qiskit-pattern-in-qcsc-prefect-step-by-step}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following steps compute the four stages in this notebook with [PySCF](https://pyscf.org/), [ffsim](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/), Qiskit, Qiskit Runtime, and [`qiskit-addon-sqd`](/addons/qiskit-addon-sqd), without Prefect. See the [SQD tutorial](/tutorials/sample-based-quantum-diagonalization) for the details of each computation.\n"
msgstr "Kinukwenta ng mga sumusunod na hakbang ang apat na stage sa notebook na ito gamit ang [PySCF](https://pyscf.org/), [ffsim](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/), Qiskit, Qiskit Runtime, at [`qiskit-addon-sqd`](/addons/qiskit-addon-sqd), nang walang Prefect. Tingnan ang [SQD tutorial](/tutorials/sample-based-quantum-diagonalization) para sa mga detalye ng bawat kalkulasyon.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1: Map classical inputs to a quantum problem {#step-1-map-classical-inputs-to-a-quantum-problem}"
msgstr "Hakbang 1: I-map ang mga classical na input sa isang quantum na problema {#step-1-map-classical-inputs-to-a-quantum-problem}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Map stage, the task `compute_molecular_integrals` in the workflow, turns the molecule into the inputs of all later stages. Restricted Hartree-Fock (RHF) gives the molecular orbitals, and the active-space integrals leave out the two frozen 1s cores. CCSD gives the $t_2$ amplitudes of the ansatz, and its density matrix gives the orbital occupancies that start configuration recovery. CCSD iterates `CCSD_MAXITER` times, each time from the previous amplitudes, so the result does not depend on the DIIS history of the first iteration. This notebook uses 4 iterations, and the workflow uses 10.\n"
msgstr "Ang Map stage, ang task na `compute_molecular_integrals` sa workflow, ay ginagawang mga input ng lahat ng susunod na stage ang molecule. Ibinibigay ng Restricted Hartree-Fock (RHF) ang mga molecular orbital, at hindi isinasama ng mga active-space integral ang dalawang frozen na 1s core. Ibinibigay ng CCSD ang mga $t_2$ amplitude ng ansatz, at ang density matrix nito ang nagbibigay ng mga orbital occupancy na nagsisimula ng configuration recovery. Umuulit ang CCSD nang `CCSD_MAXITER` beses, bawat isa mula sa mga nakaraang amplitude, kaya hindi nakadepende ang resulta sa DIIS history ng unang iteration. Gumagamit ang notebook na ito ng 4 na iteration, at 10 ang sa workflow.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"How QCSC-Prefect manages this step\">\n"
msgstr "<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Paano pinamamahalaan ng QCSC-Prefect ang hakbang na ito\">\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Trace:** The task `compute_molecular_integrals` has the tag `map`. Its result goes to `get_lucj_params` and `sqd_loop`, so two arrows leave it in the graph. The task logs show the PySCF output.\n"
msgstr "**Trace:** May tag na `map` ang task na `compute_molecular_integrals`. Napupunta ang resulta nito sa `get_lucj_params` at `sqd_loop`, kaya dalawang arrow ang lumalabas dito sa graph. Ipinapakita ng mga task log ang output ng PySCF.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Configure:** The **Molecule** group of the run form selects the problem, as an FCIDUMP file or as a geometry and basis. This workflow reads `algorithms/open_loop/sqd/data/n2_631g_fc.fcidump`, which has the cores frozen already. The number of CCSD iterations (**CCSD Restarts**, 10 by default) is in the `sqd-advanced-settings` block.\n"
msgstr "**Configure:** Pinipili ng **Molecule** group ng run form ang problema, bilang FCIDUMP file o bilang geometry at basis. Binabasa ng workflow na ito ang `algorithms/open_loop/sqd/data/n2_631g_fc.fcidump`, na naka-freeze na ang mga core. Ang bilang ng mga CCSD iteration (**CCSD Restarts**, 10 bilang default) ay nasa `sqd-advanced-settings` block.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Resume:** The result is persisted (`compressed/json`), so **Retry** loads it instead of running PySCF again.\n"
msgstr "**Resume:** Naka-persist ang resulta (`compressed/json`), kaya nilo-load ito ng **Retry** sa halip na patakbuhin muli ang PySCF.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
