# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3: Execute using Qiskit primitives {#step-3-execute-using-qiskit-primitives}"
msgstr "Hakbang 3: Mag-execute gamit ang mga Qiskit primitive {#step-3-execute-using-qiskit-primitives}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Execute stage, the task `quantum_sampling` in the workflow, builds the circuit (Hartree-Fock state, LUCJ operator, and measurement),\n"
"transpiles it for the QPU, and samples it. The ffsim `PRE_INIT` passes run first in the\n"
"transpiler and turn the ffsim gates into efficient native-gate sequences. This notebook\n"
"samples with Qiskit Runtime on `ibm_fez`. Replace `ibm_fez` with a backend that your instance\n"
"can use. The workflow samples with QRMI instead, in a Slurm job that holds the QPU.\n"
msgstr ""
"Binubuo ng Execute stage, ang task na `quantum_sampling` sa workflow, ang Circuit (Hartree-Fock state, LUCJ operator, at measurement),\n"
"it-transpile ito para sa QPU, at sina-sample ito. Una munang tumatakbo ang mga ffsim `PRE_INIT` pass sa\n"
"Transpiler at ginagawa nilang mahusay na mga sequence ng native Gate ang mga ffsim Gate. Nagsa-sample ang notebook na ito\n"
"gamit ang Qiskit Runtime sa `ibm_fez`. Palitan ang `ibm_fez` ng Backend na magagamit ng iyong instance.\n"
"Sa halip, nagsa-sample ang workflow gamit ang QRMI, sa isang Slurm job na may hawak ng QPU.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As a baseline, draw the same number of uniform random bitstrings, as the workflow does with\n"
"**Quantum Source** set to `random`. The following cell also prints the fraction of each sample\n"
"set with the correct electron numbers. Step 4 compares SQD on the two sample sets.\n"
msgstr ""
"Bilang baseline, gumuhit ng parehong bilang ng mga uniform na random na bitstring, tulad ng ginagawa ng workflow kapag naka-set ang\n"
"**Quantum Source** sa `random`. Piniprint din ng sumusunod na cell ang bahagi ng bawat sample\n"
"set na may tamang bilang ng electron. Inihahambing ng Hakbang 4 ang SQD sa dalawang sample set.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Trace:** The task `quantum_sampling` has the tag `execute`, and the task\n"
"`build_lucj_circuit` runs inside it. The workflow host prepares the circuit and submits a\n"
"Slurm job that requests the QPU. On the compute node, the SPANK plugin opens the QPU session,\n"
"and the QRMI worker transpiles and samples the circuit.\n"
"The task logs show the walltime of the Slurm job, the two-qubit depth of the transpiled\n"
"circuit, and, when sampling completes, the IBM Quantum job ID and the QPU execution time.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Trace:** May tag na `execute` ang task na `quantum_sampling`, at ang task na\n"
"`build_lucj_circuit` ay tumatakbo sa loob nito. Inihahanda ng workflow host ang Circuit at nagsa-submit ng\n"
"Slurm job na humihiling ng QPU. Sa compute node, binubuksan ng SPANK plugin ang QPU Session,\n"
"at tina-transpile at sina-sample ng QRMI worker ang Circuit.\n"
"Ipinapakita ng mga task log ang walltime ng Slurm job, ang two-qubit depth ng na-transpile na\n"
"Circuit, at, kapag tapos na ang sampling, ang IBM Quantum job ID at ang QPU execution time.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Configure:** The **Sampling** group of the run form sets the shots and the source of the\n"
"samples, which is the `qrmi-runtime` block, the job of an earlier run, or random bitstrings.\n"
"The QRMI blocks hold where and how the sampler job runs, and the credentials stay on the\n"
"cluster.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Configure:** Itinatakda ng **Sampling** group ng run form ang mga shot at ang pinagmulan ng\n"
"mga sample, ito ay ang `qrmi-runtime` block, ang job ng naunang run, o mga random na bitstring.\n"
"Hawak ng mga QRMI block kung saan at paano tumatakbo ang sampler job, at nananatili ang mga credential sa\n"
"cluster.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Resume:** The samples are persisted (`compressed/pickle`), so **Retry** submits no new QPU\n"
"job. The `sqd-sampling-source` artifact records where the samples are, so a new run can reuse\n"
"them, as in [Optional: resume and reuse the workflow](#optional-resume-and-reuse-the-workflow).\n"
msgstr ""
"**Resume:** Naka-persist ang mga sample (`compressed/pickle`), kaya walang bagong QPU\n"
"job na isinusumite ang **Retry**. Itinatala ng `sqd-sampling-source` artifact kung nasaan ang mga sample, kaya magagamit ulit ng bagong run\n"
"ang mga ito, tulad sa [Opsyonal: ipagpatuloy at gamitin muli ang workflow](#optional-resume-and-reuse-the-workflow).\n"

