msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/manage-qcsc-workflow-with-qcsc-prefect/extracted-outputs/cell-33-0.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Trace:** The task `sqd_loop` has the tag `post-process`. It receives the samples and\n"
"the integrals, so the graph shows two arrows into it. Each batch is one `FulqrumSolverJob`\n"
"call, a `solve_eigenstate` task that submits one Slurm job running Fulqrum. The batches of a\n"
"round run concurrently on the compute nodes. The `sqd-configuration-recovery` artifact lists\n"
"the energy and dimension of every subspace in every round.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Trace:** May tag na `post-process` ang task na `sqd_loop`. Tumatanggap ito ng mga sample at\n"
"ng mga integral, kaya dalawang arrow ang papasok dito sa graph. Ang bawat batch ay isang `FulqrumSolverJob`\n"
"call, isang `solve_eigenstate` task na nagsa-submit ng isang Slurm job na nagpapatakbo ng Fulqrum. Magkakasabay na tumatakbo sa mga compute node ang mga batch ng isang\n"
"round. Inililista ng `sqd-configuration-recovery` artifact\n"
"ang enerhiya at dimension ng bawat subspace sa bawat round.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Configure:** The **SQD** group of the run form sets the subspace dimension, the number of\n"
"batches, and the number of rounds. **Solver Block Override** (`solver_block_ref`) in the\n"
"run form replaces the **Solver Block** of `sqd-advanced-settings` for one run, for example with\n"
"a DICE or SBD block. The eigensolver (PRIMME), threads, and walltime are in the\n"
"`sqd-fulqrum-solver` block and its execution profile. The flow loads the solver block before\n"
"any stage, so a wrong block name fails the run before it uses the QPU.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Configure:** Itinatakda ng **SQD** group ng run form ang subspace dimension, ang bilang ng\n"
"batch, at ang bilang ng round. Pinapalitan ng **Solver Block Override** (`solver_block_ref`) sa\n"
"run form ang **Solver Block** ng `sqd-advanced-settings` para sa isang run, halimbawa ng\n"
"isang DICE o SBD block. Ang eigensolver (PRIMME), mga thread, at walltime ay nasa\n"
"`sqd-fulqrum-solver` block at sa execution profile nito. Nilo-load ng flow ang solver block bago ang\n"
"anumang stage, kaya pumapalya ang run bago nito magamit ang QPU kung mali ang pangalan ng block.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Resume:** `sqd_loop` is not cached, but it saves a checkpoint after every round, in\n"
"`sqd_checkpoints/<flow run id>/ckpt_t00_w0.npz` under the solver's `work_dir`. The checkpoint\n"
"holds the occupancies that seed the next round and the best energy so far. On **Retry**,\n"
"`sqd_loop` continues after the last completed round, with the current blocks.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Resume:** Hindi kino-cache ang `sqd_loop`, pero nagse-save ito ng checkpoint pagkatapos ng bawat round, sa\n"
"`sqd_checkpoints/<flow run id>/ckpt_t00_w0.npz` sa ilalim ng `work_dir` ng solver. Hawak ng checkpoint\n"
"ang mga occupancy na nagsisimula sa susunod na round at ang pinakamahusay na enerhiya sa ngayon. Sa **Retry**,\n"
"tumutuloy ang `sqd_loop` pagkatapos ng huling nakumpletong round, gamit ang kasalukuyang mga block.\n"

