"| &mdash; | Advanced Settings Block | `sqd-advanced-settings` |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A path relative to the `~/qcsc-prefect` checkout also works. `algorithms/open_loop/sqd/default_params/n2.json` holds the same parameters for scripted runs. **Checkpoint Recovery** adds a folder of less than 1 MB per run under `work_dir/sqd_checkpoints/`, even for 1000 orbitals, and nothing removes it.\n"
msgstr "Gumagana rin ang path na relatibo sa `~/qcsc-prefect` checkout. Hawak ng `algorithms/open_loop/sqd/default_params/n2.json` ang parehong mga parameter para sa mga scripted na run. Nagdaragdag ang **Checkpoint Recovery** ng folder na wala pang 1 MB bawat run sa ilalim ng `work_dir/sqd_checkpoints/`, kahit para sa 1000 orbital, at walang nag-aalis nito.\n"

