# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For a first run without the QPU, set **Quantum Source** to `random`, which runs the solver jobs on uniform random bitstrings. To sample through IBM Quantum Platform (IQP) from the workflow host instead of a Slurm job, save a `QrmiRuntimeBlock` with `scheduler = \"iqp\"` (the `[runtime]` table of `sqd_blocks.toml`, in place of `[qrmi]`), and name it in **QRMI Runtime Block**. This block reads the API key from the `qrmi_config.json` file of the workflow host.\n"
msgstr "Para sa unang run na walang QPU, itakda ang **Quantum Source** sa `random`, na nagpapatakbo ng mga solver job sa mga uniform na random na bitstring. Para mag-sample sa pamamagitan ng IBM Quantum Platform (IQP) mula sa workflow host sa halip na sa Slurm job, mag-save ng `QrmiRuntimeBlock` na may `scheduler = \"iqp\"` (ang `[runtime]` table ng `sqd_blocks.toml`, kapalit ng `[qrmi]`), at pangalanan ito sa **QRMI Runtime Block**. Binabasa ng block na ito ang API key mula sa `qrmi_config.json` file ng workflow host.\n"

