# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The energy that the flow reports is the lowest energy in the `sqd-configuration-recovery` table. Each solver job leaves a `job_<timestamp>_<id>` directory under `work_dir`. The directory holds the rendered Slurm script, `input.npz`, `solver.json`, and the Slurm output. It also holds `output.npz` and `result.json` on success, or `error.json` on failure. Use `sacct` to see the jobs of the run.\n"
msgstr "Ang enerhiyang iniuulat ng flow ay ang pinakamababang enerhiya sa `sqd-configuration-recovery` table. Nag-iiwan ang bawat solver job ng `job_<timestamp>_<id>` directory sa ilalim ng `work_dir`. Hawak ng directory ang na-render na Slurm script, `input.npz`, `solver.json`, at ang Slurm output. Hawak din nito ang `output.npz` at `result.json` kapag matagumpay, o `error.json` kapag nabigo. Gamitin ang `sacct` para makita ang mga job ng run.\n"

